OL,3,AThree children and one teacher killed
OL,4,Aafter 16-year-old opens fire at Oregon
OL,5,Aprimary school
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour people have reportedly been killed
OL,8,Fin a shooting at an elementary school
OL,9,Fin the US state of Oregon, local police
OL,10,Fsay
OL,12,FThree of the victims were children and
OL,13,Fone was an adult, the BBC's US partner
OL,14,FCBS News reports. Officials say the
OL,15,Fshooter is dead
OL,17,FPolice in Bend, Oregon responded to
OL,18,FSilver Rail Elementary School Thursday
OL,19,Fafternoon on reports that an unknown
OL,20,Fsuspect had fired at a car before
OL,21,Fentering the school
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
