OL,3,AThree children and one teacher killed
OL,4,Aafter 16-year-old opens fire at Oregon
OL,5,Aprimary school
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages show bullet holes in a red truck
OL,8,Foutside of the campus
OL,10,FThe suspect was a 16-year-old boy, CBS
OL,11,Freports, and was reportedly shot dead
OL,12,Fby a bystander
OL,14,F"We are stunned and heartbroken by this
OL,15,Fsenseless tragedy," school
OL,16,Fsuperintendent Steven Cook said
OL,18,FThe identities of the suspect or the
OL,19,Fvictims have not been released, but
OL,20,Flocal officials are set to give a news
OL,21,Fconference shortly - watch live above
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
